        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 20,
        "en": "because there are over 2 million internally displaced people and there doesn’t seem to be a real coherent plan to help them and there’s lots of good will and lots of discussion — but just a lot of talk at the moment and a lot of pieces need to be put together.",
        "at": "and there’s lots of good will",
