      },
      {
        "sentence": 25,
        "en": "So far the different officials I’ve met with and different local people I’ve met with all have shared concerns and very strongly, you know, they have spoken out about the humanitarian crisis but um, there seems to be a block in.",
        "at": "and very strongly,",
